      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I received the VRC+ billing statement a few days ago, have already paid it, and can confirm the payment in my Steam purchase history. It also still shows as active on the Steam subscriptions page.\n\nAdditionally, when I click the button to subscribe to VRC+ from within VRChat, I get an error message saying “[UserID] already has an active subscription!”\n\nBased on this, there is no doubt that I am subscribed.",
