  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Even though I'm a VRChat Plus subscriber, all my subscription benefits were suddenly locked and I can no longer use them.\n\nI think I was able to use the membership perks without any problems when I was playing VRChat half a day ago.\n\nThis issue is also occurring in the open beta [1912].\n\nI’ve been a VRChat Plus subscriber ever since the subscription service launched, as a way to support VRChat, and I hope this bug won’t cause my support to be interrupted.",
